      "content": "Progressive taxation takes a while to implement in the simulation engine, though. In the meantime, how are you managing the information flow? I noticed a slight dip in \"public discontent\" metrics despite the wealth gap rising—is the news feed reflecting the actual economic data, or are you adjusting the narrative to prevent social unrest?",
